// ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
// ┃  niri — MACHINE-AGNOSTIC BASE                               ┃
// ┃  Managed by home-manager. Do not edit in place: this file is ┃
// ┃  a read-only symlink into /nix/store. Edit the source in     ┃
// ┃  cheroot-config/config/niri/config.kdl and re-switch.        ┃
// ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛
//
// @HOME@ is substituted with the real home directory at build time.
//
// NOTE ON OUTPUTS: there are deliberately NO `output` blocks here.
// niri enables every connected output at its preferred mode by default, which
// is exactly the portable behaviour we want across laptop and desktop. Adding
// output blocks is what BREAKS portability. Host-specific overrides (e.g. a
// scale for the internal panel) are appended by hosts/<host>.nix.
// Do not add kanshi: it races with niri (niri-wm/niri#676).

// ======= Input =======
input {
    keyboard {
        repeat-rate 35
        repeat-delay 250
        xkb {
        }
    }

    // Laptop trackpad. Harmless on a desktop with no touchpad.
    touchpad {
        tap
        natural-scroll
        dwt                    // disable-while-typing
        accel-profile "adaptive"
        scroll-method "two-finger"
    }

    mouse {
        // accel-speed 0.0
    }

    focus-follows-mouse max-scroll-amount="0%"
    warp-mouse-to-focus
}

// ======= Layout =======
layout {
    gaps 5
    center-focused-column "never"

    preset-column-widths {
        proportion 0.33333
        proportion 0.5
        proportion 0.66667
    }

    default-column-width {
        proportion 0.5
    }

    focus-ring {
        off
    }

    border {
        width 3
        active-color "#8b3d3d"
        inactive-color "#4a2222"
    }

    struts {
        left 5
        right 5
        top 5
        bottom 5
    }
}

// ======= Visual =======
prefer-no-csd

animations {
}

// ======= Window Rules =======
window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^blueman-manager$"#
    open-floating true
}
window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^xdg-desktop-portal"#
    open-floating true
}
window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^polkit-"#
    open-floating true
}
window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^org\.kde\.polkit"#
    open-floating true
}
window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^zenity$"#
    open-floating true
}
window-rule {
    match title="Picture-in-Picture"
    open-floating true
}
window-rule {
    match title="Picture in picture"
    open-floating true
}
window-rule {
    match title="Save File"
    open-floating true
}
window-rule {
    match title="Open File"
    open-floating true
}

// Opacity
window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^(thunar|nemo|nautilus)$"#
    opacity 0.97
}
window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^(discord|armcord|webcord)$"#
    opacity 0.96
}

// Corner radius for all windows
window-rule {
    geometry-corner-radius 4 4 4 4
    clip-to-geometry true
}

// ======= Cursor =======
// Default Adwaita theme — the vimix-kanagawa theme is not installed everywhere,
// and a missing cursor theme yields an invisible pointer.
cursor {
    xcursor-theme "Adwaita"
    xcursor-size 24
}

// ======= Environment =======
environment {
    DISPLAY ":0"
    QT_CURSOR_SIZE "24"
    XCURSOR_SIZE "24"
}

// ======= Autostart =======
spawn-at-startup "xwayland-satellite"
spawn-at-startup "swaybg" "-o" "*" "-i" "@HOME@/.local/share/wallpaper/wallpaper.jpg" "-m" "fill"
spawn-at-startup "waybar"
spawn-at-startup "mako"
spawn-at-startup "/usr/lib/polkit-gnome/polkit-gnome-authentication-agent-1"
spawn-at-startup "swayidle" "-w" "timeout" "600" "swaylock -f -c 000000" "before-sleep" "swaylock -f -c 000000"

// Notes terminal: attaches (or creates) a persistent tmux session showing the
// handoff notes in neovim. Survives logout because the tmux server does.
spawn-at-startup "alacritty" "--title" "notes" "-e" "tmux" "new-session" "-A" "-s" "notes"

// systemd/dbus integration — required for portals and user services
spawn-at-startup "sh" "-c" "systemctl --user import-environment WAYLAND_DISPLAY XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP && dbus-update-activation-environment --systemd WAYLAND_DISPLAY XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP=niri"

// ======= Key Bindings =======
binds {
    // ─── Launch ───
    Mod+Return { spawn "alacritty"; }
    Mod+E      { spawn "alacritty" "-e" "yazi"; }
    Mod+Space  { spawn "fuzzel"; }
    Mod+A      { spawn "sh" "-c" "grim -g \"$(slurp)\" - | swappy -f -"; }
    Mod+O      { toggle-overview; }
    Mod+G      { power-off-monitors; }

    // ─── Notifications (Mod+Alt namespace) ───
    Mod+Alt+N       { spawn "@HOME@/.config/mako/mako-term.sh"; }
    Mod+Alt+D       { spawn "makoctl" "dismiss"; }
    Mod+Alt+Shift+D { spawn "makoctl" "dismiss" "-a"; }
    Mod+Alt+R       { spawn "makoctl" "restore"; }

    // ─── Window Actions ───
    Mod+Q       { close-window; }
    Mod+Shift+M { quit skip-confirmation=true; }
    Mod+F       { maximize-column; }
    Mod+Shift+F { fullscreen-window; }
    Mod+V       { toggle-window-floating; }

    // ─── Focus ───
    Mod+H     { focus-column-left; }
    Mod+L     { focus-column-right; }
    Mod+J     { focus-window-or-workspace-down; }
    Mod+K     { focus-window-or-workspace-up; }
    Mod+N     { focus-monitor-down; }
    Mod+P     { focus-monitor-up; }
    Mod+Left  { focus-column-left; }
    Mod+Right { focus-column-right; }
    Mod+Down  { focus-window-or-workspace-down; }
    Mod+Up    { focus-window-or-workspace-up; }

    // ─── Move Windows ───
    Mod+Shift+H     { spawn "sh" "-c" "niri msg action reset-window-height; niri msg action consume-or-expel-window-left"; }
    Mod+Shift+L     { spawn "sh" "-c" "niri msg action reset-window-height; niri msg action consume-or-expel-window-right"; }
    Mod+Shift+J     { move-window-down-or-to-workspace-down; }
    Mod+Shift+K     { move-window-up-or-to-workspace-up; }
    Mod+Shift+N     { move-column-to-monitor-down; }
    Mod+Shift+P     { move-column-to-monitor-up; }
    Mod+Shift+Left  { spawn "sh" "-c" "niri msg action reset-window-height; niri msg action consume-or-expel-window-left"; }
    Mod+Shift+Right { spawn "sh" "-c" "niri msg action reset-window-height; niri msg action consume-or-expel-window-right"; }
    Mod+Shift+Down  { move-window-down-or-to-workspace-down; }
    Mod+Shift+Up    { move-window-up-or-to-workspace-up; }

    // ─── Resize ───
    Mod+Ctrl+Shift+H     { set-column-width "-5%"; }
    Mod+Ctrl+Shift+L     { set-column-width "+5%"; }
    Mod+Ctrl+Shift+K     { set-window-height "-5%"; }
    Mod+Ctrl+Shift+J     { set-window-height "+5%"; }
    Mod+Ctrl+Shift+Left  { set-column-width "-5%"; }
    Mod+Ctrl+Shift+Right { set-column-width "+5%"; }
    Mod+Ctrl+Shift+Up    { set-window-height "-5%"; }
    Mod+Ctrl+Shift+Down  { set-window-height "+5%"; }
    Mod+R                { switch-preset-column-width; }
    Mod+Minus            { set-column-width "-10%"; }
    Mod+Equal            { set-column-width "+10%"; }
    Mod+C                { center-column; }

    // ─── Workspaces ───
    Mod+1 { focus-workspace 1; }
    Mod+2 { focus-workspace 2; }
    Mod+3 { focus-workspace 3; }
    Mod+4 { focus-workspace 4; }
    Mod+5 { focus-workspace 5; }
    Mod+6 { focus-workspace 6; }
    Mod+7 { focus-workspace 7; }
    Mod+8 { focus-workspace 8; }
    Mod+9 { focus-workspace 9; }
    Mod+0 { focus-workspace 10; }

    Mod+Ctrl+1 { move-column-to-workspace 1; }
    Mod+Ctrl+2 { move-column-to-workspace 2; }
    Mod+Ctrl+3 { move-column-to-workspace 3; }
    Mod+Ctrl+4 { move-column-to-workspace 4; }
    Mod+Ctrl+5 { move-column-to-workspace 5; }
    Mod+Ctrl+6 { move-column-to-workspace 6; }
    Mod+Ctrl+7 { move-column-to-workspace 7; }
    Mod+Ctrl+8 { move-column-to-workspace 8; }
    Mod+Ctrl+9 { move-column-to-workspace 9; }
    Mod+Ctrl+0 { move-column-to-workspace 10; }

    Mod+Shift+1 { move-column-to-workspace 1; }
    Mod+Shift+2 { move-column-to-workspace 2; }
    Mod+Shift+3 { move-column-to-workspace 3; }
    Mod+Shift+4 { move-column-to-workspace 4; }
    Mod+Shift+5 { move-column-to-workspace 5; }
    Mod+Shift+6 { move-column-to-workspace 6; }
    Mod+Shift+7 { move-column-to-workspace 7; }
    Mod+Shift+8 { move-column-to-workspace 8; }
    Mod+Shift+9 { move-column-to-workspace 9; }
    Mod+Shift+0 { move-column-to-workspace 10; }

    Mod+WheelScrollDown cooldown-ms=150 { focus-workspace-down; }
    Mod+WheelScrollUp   cooldown-ms=150 { focus-workspace-up; }
    Mod+Slash { focus-workspace-previous; }

    // ─── Monitors ───
    Mod+Ctrl+Left  { move-workspace-to-monitor-left; }
    Mod+Ctrl+Right { move-workspace-to-monitor-right; }
    Mod+Ctrl+Up    { move-workspace-to-monitor-up; }
    Mod+Ctrl+Down  { move-workspace-to-monitor-down; }

    // ─── Volume ───
    XF86AudioRaiseVolume allow-when-locked=true { spawn "sh" "-c" "pactl set-sink-volume @DEFAULT_SINK@ +5%"; }
    XF86AudioLowerVolume allow-when-locked=true { spawn "sh" "-c" "pactl set-sink-volume @DEFAULT_SINK@ -5%"; }
    XF86AudioMute        allow-when-locked=true { spawn "sh" "-c" "pactl set-sink-mute @DEFAULT_SINK@ toggle"; }
    XF86AudioMicMute     allow-when-locked=true { spawn "sh" "-c" "pactl set-source-mute @DEFAULT_SOURCE@ toggle"; }

    // ─── Playback ───
    XF86AudioPlay allow-when-locked=true { spawn "playerctl" "play-pause"; }
    XF86AudioNext allow-when-locked=true { spawn "playerctl" "next"; }
    XF86AudioPrev allow-when-locked=true { spawn "playerctl" "previous"; }

    // ─── Brightness (laptop) ───
    XF86MonBrightnessUp   allow-when-locked=true { spawn "brightnessctl" "s" "+5%"; }
    XF86MonBrightnessDown allow-when-locked=true { spawn "brightnessctl" "s" "5%-"; }

    // ─── Screenshots ───
    Print      { screenshot; }
    Ctrl+Print { screenshot-window; }
    Alt+Print  { screenshot-screen; }

    // ─── Session ───
    Mod+Shift+R { spawn "niri" "msg" "action" "load-config-file"; }
    Mod+Shift+E { spawn "swaylock" "-f" "-c" "000000"; }
}
